{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: added the explicit prior `d ~ uniform(2, 100);` before the likelihood. This matches the parameter's existing finite bounds and is density-neutral up to a constant for the original constrained parameter, while satisfying SafeStan's requirement that each parameter have exactly one built-in prior sampling statement before use. The data file is unchanged.
","model_safe_stan":"//# estimated the degree of freedom (dof) from 
//# samples by sim.stan
// http://www.openbugs.net/Examples/t-df.html

//# estimate dof using continuous priors 

data {
  int<lower=0> N;
  array[N] real y;
}
parameters {
  // learning about the dof as a continuous quantity
  real<lower=2, upper=100> d;
}
model {
  d ~ uniform(2, 100);
  y ~ student_t(d, 0, 1);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N":2,"y":[2.0,2.0]}","protected_variables":["y"]}
